Cursor prompt (copy this verbatim into the Flutter project)



Replace Riverpod, GoRouter, and webview_flutter with whatever the project already uses before pasting. Everything below the line is the prompt.



Implement a complete Donations + Paystack flow in this Flutter app, integrated with the existing Node.js backend.

Stack to use





Flutter (latest stable, null-safe)



State management: Riverpod (match what the project already uses; do not introduce a new state lib)



HTTP: existing Dio client with auth interceptor (do not create a new one)



WebView: webview_flutter ^4.x



Routing: existing router (GoRouter / Navigator) — do not switch



Date / currency: intl

Backend contract (locked)





GET /api/v1/donations — list approved + visible donations.



POST /api/v1/donations/:id/donate





Body: { amount: number (>=10), currency?: "ZAR", note?: string (<=280), callbackUrl?: string }



Response: { reference, authorization_url, authorizationUrl, accessCode, publicKey, amount, currency, donation: { _id, title }, contributionId, contributionNumber }



GET /api/v1/payments/verify/:reference — idempotent. Returns { status: "success"|"failed"|"abandoned"|"unknown", alreadyPaid, payment, contribution }. Only status === "success" counts as paid.



GET /api/v1/donations/contributions/my?page&limit&paymentStatus — paginated history.

All endpoints require Authorization: Bearer <Firebase ID token> (existing interceptor handles this).

